# Cloudflare Pages: the header version of the noindex that is already in every
# page's <head>. A header covers the files a meta tag cannot — the PNGs, the
# SVGs, the PDF and the .docx — so a stray link to a cover image cannot put the
# kit in an index either.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive, noimageindex
